[
  {
    "id":"conditional-inspection","category":"流程","name":"数量判定 → 合格 / 复检 → 汇合",
    "image":"parts.png",
    "description":"检测 3 个轮廓，与期望数量比较。合格分支或复检分支只执行一路，汇合后保存该路结果。修改条件节点的比较值可切换分支。",
    "expected":"比较值为 3 时 route=OK；改为 4 时 route=RECHECK。另一分支明确显示已跳过，汇合结果写入 inspectionRoute。",
    "steps":[
      {"operation":"geometry","params":{"feature":"contours","minArea":50}},
      {"operation":"condition","params":{"comparison":"eq","left":0,"right":3}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"route","mode":"set","value":"OK"}},
      {"operation":"delay","params":{"milliseconds":250}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"route","mode":"set","value":"RECHECK"}},
      {"operation":"branch_merge","params":{}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"inspectionRoute","mode":"set","value":""}}
    ],
    "connections":[[-1,0],[0,1],[1,2,"true"],[1,3,"false"],[3,4],[2,5],[4,5],[5,6]],
    "bindings":[{"step":1,"param":"left","source":0,"field":"count"},{"step":6,"param":"value","source":5,"field":"value.value"}]
  },
  {
    "id":"typed-variables-pass","category":"流程","name":"固定类型变量 → 检测数量",
    "image":"parts.png","variables":{"count":0,"accepted":false},"variableTypes":{"count":"integer","accepted":"boolean"},
    "description":"轮廓数量写入固定整数变量，再保存模块开关。变量管理中可查看并修改类型约束。",
    "expected":"检测 3 个轮廓；流程 count=3、accepted=是，模块 done=是。初始值和类型均以表格配置。",
    "steps":[
      {"operation":"geometry","params":{"feature":"contours","minArea":50}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"count","value":0}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"accepted","value":true}},
      {"operation":"variables","variables":{"done":false},"variableTypes":{"done":"boolean"},"params":{"scope":"module","name":"done","value":true}}
    ],
    "bindings":[{"step":1,"param":"value","source":0,"field":"count"}]
  },
  {
    "id":"typed-variables-reject","category":"流程","name":"固定类型变量 → 拦截错误赋值",
    "image":"parts.png","variables":{"count":0,"accepted":false},"variableTypes":{"count":"integer","accepted":"boolean"},
    "description":"先将 accepted 设为是，再尝试向整数 count 写入文本。应在错误节点停止并回滚本轮全部变量。",
    "expected":"第二步报 count 类型不匹配，第三步不执行；变量仍为 count=0、accepted=否。将第二步赋值类型改为数值、内容改为 3 后可运行成功。",
    "steps":[
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"accepted","value":true}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"count","value":"3"}},
      {"operation":"variables","params":{"scope":"flow","name":"reached","value":true}}
    ]
  }
]
